### Posts API Tests


### Base URL

@host = http://localhost:8080/api


### Create a new post

# @name createPost

POST {{host}}/posts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "content": "Spring Boot 3 brings many exciting features including native image support, improved observability, and Java 17+ baseline...",
  "excerpt": "Learn about the new features in Spring Boot 3",
  "featuredImage": "https://example.com/images/spring-boot-3.jpg",
  "slug": "getting-started-with-spring-boot-3",
  "status": "draft",
  "title": "Getting Started with Spring Boot 3"
}


### 


### Update a post

# @name updatePost

PUT {{host}}/posts/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "content": "Updated content about Spring Boot 3...",
  "status": "published",
  "title": "Getting Started with Spring Boot 3 - Updated"
}


### 


### Get a single post by ID

# @name getPost

GET {{host}}/posts/8 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get a single post by slug (cached endpoint)

# @name getPostBySlug

GET {{host}}/posts/slug/getting-started-with-spring-boot-3 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get all published posts (with pagination and sorting)

# @name getPosts

GET {{host}}/posts?page=1&size=10&sort=id,asc HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get posts with different sorting

# @name getPostsSortedByTitle

GET {{host}}/posts?page=1&size=10&sortBy=title&sortDir=ASC HTTP/1.1


### 


### Search posts by keyword

# @name searchPosts

GET {{host}}/posts/search?keyword=what&page=0&size=10 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get posts by user

# @name getUserPosts

GET {{host}}/posts/user/1?page=1&size=10 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get posts by category

# @name getCategoryPosts

GET {{host}}/posts/category/3?page=1&size=10 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Delete a post

# @name deletePost

DELETE {{host}}/posts/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{userAuth}}


### 


### Test pagination - Second page

# @name getPostsPage2

GET {{host}}/posts?page=1&size=5 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Test invalid post ID (should return 404)

# @name getInvalidPost

GET {{host}}/posts/99999 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Test create post with missing required fields (validation)

# @name createInvalidPost

POST {{host}}/posts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "content": "",
  "title": ""
}


### 


### Test create post without authentication (should fail)

# @name createPostWithoutAuth

POST {{host}}/posts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Test Content",
  "title": "Test Post"
}


### 


### Filter posts by status (if implemented)

# @name getPublishedPosts

GET {{host}}/posts?status=published&page=0&size=10 HTTP/1.1


